    comingSoon: false,
    minPlayers: 2,
    maxPlayers: 4,
    routePath: 'one-eyed-jack',
    LLM: 'Game: One-Eyed Jack. Progression: [Deal -> Play(play_card, place_chip) -> Draw -> next player | Win check]. Board 10x10, card spaces. Play card â†’ chip on matching space (or jack power). Two-eyed jack (clubs, diamonds) = place on any empty. One-eyed jack (hearts, spades) = remove opponent chip. First row of 5 (horizontal, vertical, diagonal) wins. Draw at end of turn.',
    Player: "Play a card, put a chip on the matching space. Two-eyed jacks let you place on any empty space. One-eyed jacks let you remove an opponent's chip. First to get five in a row wins.",
    tagline: 'Match cards to spaces. Form rows of five. Two-eyed wild, one-eyed kills.',
